SLIDE 08 | 1:15 | The application is an evidence-seeking agent
DELIVERY: Explain the diagram from personas to response, then the controls along the bottom.

The application diagram shows how users interact with the foundation. Contract Operations, Finance, Compliance, Network Strategy, and leadership enter through a natural-language interface with contract views, dashboards, alerts, and document access. In the backend, query understanding identifies intent and data requirements. A retrieval orchestrator then chooses the right combination of structured data, vector search, business rules, calculations, and original documents. The AI and analytics engine synthesizes only after the evidence has been gathered. Validation checks citations, confidence, completeness, and whether the answer is actually supported. The response is delivered with source links, page references, supporting tables, confidence indicators, and suggested follow-up questions. Underneath, role-based security, audit monitoring, governance, and user feedback make the process controllable. Sixteen question routes and more than thirty specialized tools allow one question to use different capabilities - for example, a rate lookup, an amendment-chain traversal, a comparison, and a calculation. AI coordinates the work; it does not replace the data model or business logic.

